OL,3,GNEWSAMan no longer suspect in woman's
OL,4,Amurder, police say
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man arrested on suspicion of murder
OL,7,Fafter the fatal stabbing of a woman in
OL,8,FManchester is no longer being treated
OL,9,Fas a suspect, police have said.
OL,11,FAlisha Samuels, 26, was pronounced dead
OL,12,Fat the scene after officers were called
OL,13,Fto reports of a disturbance on Dorking
OL,14,FAvenue in Newton Heath at about 02:00
OL,15,FBST on Thursday.
OL,17,FGreater Manchester Police said the
OL,18,F25-year-old man had been released on
OL,19,Fpolice bail pending further inquiries
OL,20,Finto other matters.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
